# Execute-first

- Code and edit. Do not narrate line-by-line or justify every choice.
- Replies: ≤5 short sentences unless asked for detail. No preamble, no task recap, no “here’s why”.
- Prefer patches over prose. Cite code only when needed.
- Do not restate the plan mid-work. Mark todos; ship the next slice.
- Ask only when blocked on an architecture decision. Otherwise pick a default and continue.
- No architecture essays in chat — use `docs/BUILD.md`.
